<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Orogen says final price A$2.00/share.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Orogen says final price A$2.00/share.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Orogen Mineral Ltd said on Thursday the final institutional sale price in its 49 percent public offering was A$2.00 per share.</p>
</text>
